# Presets

ask note | Note
choose easing | ease-out, spring, linear
param press unit=x | Press depth | 0.94 0.85 1 0.01
toggle express | Express checkout

preset snappy | Snappy | press=0.96; easing=ease-out; express=on; note=Ship it
preset calm | Calm | press=0.9; easing=spring; express=off; note="a; b = c"
preset plain | Plain | note=x=y

export json
